{
  "name": "Website Contact, Social & Tech Stack Enricher (Webhook -> Google Sheets)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "website-contact-tech-enrich",
        "responseMode": "lastNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "webhook-domains-trigger",
      "name": "Webhook (Receive Domain List)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        200,
        320
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.apify.com/v2/acts/yannabadie~website-contact-tech-enricher-mcp/run-sync-get-dataset-items",
        "sendQuery": true,
        "queryParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "token",
              "value": "={{$env.APIFY_TOKEN}}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={\n  \"mode\": \"enrich\",\n  \"domains\": {{JSON.stringify($json.body?.domains || ['apify.com', 'linear.app'])}},\n  \"maxPagesPerDomain\": 3,\n  \"onlyWithEmail\": false,\n  \"maxDomains\": 100\n}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 60000
        }
      },
      "id": "apify-enrich-call",
      "name": "Enrich Domains (Contacts + Tech Stack)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        460,
        320
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "valid-domain",
              "leftValue": "={{$json.domain}}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "notEmpty"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "reachable-http",
              "leftValue": "={{$json.httpStatus}}",
              "rightValue": 0,
              "operator": {
                "type": "number",
                "operation": "gt"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        }
      },
      "id": "filter-reachable-domains",
      "name": "Keep Reachable Domains",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.filter",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        720,
        320
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "flat-tech-stack",
              "name": "techStackCsv",
              "value": "={{($json.techStack || []).join(', ')}}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "flat-emails",
              "name": "allEmailsCsv",
              "value": "={{($json.emails || []).join(', ')}}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "linkedin-profile",
              "name": "linkedinUrl",
              "value": "={{$json.socials?.linkedin || ''}}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "includeOtherFields": true
      },
      "id": "set-flatten-enrichment",
      "name": "Flatten Tech Stack & Socials",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        960,
        320
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "appendOrUpdate",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "REPLACE_WITH_GOOGLE_SHEET_ID",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "Enriched_Domains",
          "mode": "name"
        },
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "defineBelow",
          "value": {
            "domain": "={{$json.domain}}",
            "httpStatus": "={{$json.httpStatus}}",
            "title": "={{$json.title}}",
            "primaryEmail": "={{$json.primaryEmail}}",
            "allEmails": "={{$json.allEmailsCsv}}",
            "primaryPhone": "={{$json.primaryPhone}}",
            "linkedinUrl": "={{$json.linkedinUrl}}",
            "techStack": "={{$json.techStackCsv}}",
            "pagesCrawled": "={{$json.pagesCrawled}}",
            "hasContactPage": "={{$json.hasContactPage}}",
            "hasLegalPage": "={{$json.hasLegalPage}}",
            "finalUrl": "={{$json.finalUrl}}"
          },
          "matchingColumns": [
            "domain"
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "sheets-enrich-upsert",
      "name": "Upsert Enriched Leads to Google Sheets",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [
        1220,
        320
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Website Contact & 54-Tech Stack Enricher\n1. Set n8n env var `APIFY_TOKEN` (zero hardcoded secrets).\n2. Replace `REPLACE_WITH_GOOGLE_SHEET_ID` in **Upsert Enriched Leads to Google Sheets**.\n3. Test via `POST /webhook-test/website-contact-tech-enrich` with body `{\"domains\": [\"apify.com\", \"linear.app\"]}`.",
        "height": 195,
        "width": 540,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "sticky-enrich-setup",
      "name": "Setup & Webhook Test",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        180,
        40
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Clean CRM-Ready Output\n- **Keep Reachable Domains** filters out failed DNS/HTTP entries.\n- **Flatten Tech Stack & Socials** converts arrays (`techStack`, `emails`) into spreadsheet-ready CSV strings.\n- **Upsert** deduplicates cleanly on `domain`.",
        "height": 175,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "sticky-enrich-output",
      "name": "Normalization & Upsert Notes",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        760,
        40
      ]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Webhook (Receive Domain List)": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Enrich Domains (Contacts + Tech Stack)",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Enrich Domains (Contacts + Tech Stack)": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Keep Reachable Domains",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Keep Reachable Domains": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Flatten Tech Stack & Socials",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Flatten Tech Stack & Socials": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Upsert Enriched Leads to Google Sheets",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  },
  "meta": {
    "templateCredsSetupCompleted": false,
    "instanceId": "yannabadie-website-enrich-template-v1"
  }
}
